## 4. Time & Calendar

**Wake hour: 2 PM.** Player wakes at 14:00 in-game, day rolls at 14:00 the next day. This is a 90s-criminal-life-sim tonal choice — the player keeps vampire hours.

**Sleep window: 06:00–14:00.** This is a hard window during which game logic considers the player asleep. Pages don't fire. Customers don't try to meet. NPC schedules respect it for "this NPC sleeps too" behavior.

**Day display granularity: 10 minutes.** HUD shows time rounded to the nearest 10. Internal calculations use exact minutes.

**Single integer `total_minutes` is source of truth.** All other queries derive (current_hour, current_minute, day_of_week, day_of_month).

**Day-of-week.** Indexed 0 = Mon, 6 = Sun. Rent is due Sunday (dow == 6). Saturday is the warning day.

**Pause counter, not bool.** Multiple systems can pause concurrently. Time runs only when count is zero.

