## 6.5. NotificationSystem ✅ COMPLETE

A global notification autoload that any system can call to surface short messages to the player. Replaces the "every feature has its own HUD label" trap.

```
NotificationSystem.info("Rent paid")
NotificationSystem.loot(item, count)
NotificationSystem.warn("Can't place here")
NotificationSystem.error("Inventory full")
```

A single HUD widget (`NotificationLabel`) listens to the broadcast signal and renders messages as a vertical stack of color-coded labels that fade out after 3 seconds. Max 5 visible at once; oldest evicted on overflow.

Used by car looting, vendor refusals, rent system, locked doors, skateboard activation refusal, pager activation, street-deal outcomes. Also the right call for: page received, DEX/CRIM tier-up, placement refused, skill threshold crossed.

