## §Y ItemStack per-instance data (architectural note)

`ItemStack` now carries an arbitrary `data: Dictionary` for per-instance state.
- Empty for most items.
- Populated for cards, future durability, etc.
- `can_merge_with` requires identical `data` — prevents inappropriate merging.
- `ItemDef.initial_stack_data()` virtual: subclasses (e.g. `CallingCardDef`) override to seed fresh stacks.

